{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02507","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得鲜 · 刘孝孙","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得鲜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解襟游胜地，披云促宴筵。\n清文振笔妙，高论写言泉。\n冻柳含风落，寒梅照日鲜。\n骊歌虽欲奏，归驾且留连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘孝孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}